flowchart TB
  accTitle: Verification flow for VULNERABLE and HARDENED modes
  accDescr: The app is started once per mode and scanned with security-lab scan. A refused target exits with 2 before any request. Failed prerequisites give ERROR and exit 3. Otherwise six checks give PASS, FAIL or ERROR, and the results are compared with the expectation for each mode.
  start["Start the app once per mode<br/>VULNERABLE on port 8000<br/>HARDENED on port 8001"]
  scan["security-lab scan URL<br/>--expected-mode MODE"]
  refuse["Target refused<br/>exit 2, no request sent"]
  pre["Prerequisites<br/>/health service and mode<br/>synthetic logins"]
  err["Affected checks: ERROR<br/>exit 3, never a pass"]
  checks["Six checks, LAB-01 to LAB-06<br/>each PASS, FAIL or ERROR"]
  vul["VULNERABLE expected<br/>6 FAIL<br/>HIGH 1, MEDIUM 4, LOW 1"]
  har["HARDENED expected<br/>6 PASS, findings 0"]
  cmp["Compare with expectation<br/>(CI evidence gate)"]
  start --> scan
  scan -->|"valid local URL"| pre
  scan -->|"refused"| refuse
  pre -->|"not established"| err
  pre -->|"established"| checks
  checks --> vul
  checks --> har
  vul --> cmp
  har --> cmp
